---
// Monotonic Increasing ID vs Random UUIDv4 B+ Tree Storage Impact Diagram
---

<figure class="id-split-diagram" aria-labelledby="id-split-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG layout (ViewBox 840x320, clean 2-column comparison, large fonts, 28px bottom padding) -->
  <svg
    class="id-split-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 840 320"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="id-split-title id-split-desc"
  >
    <title id="id-split-title">
      順序單調遞增 ID vs. 隨機 UUIDv4 在 InnoDB B+ Tree 中的寫入差異
    </title>
    <desc id="id-split-desc">
      左側展示順序單調遞增 ID (Snowflake/UUIDv7) 順序追加至末尾 Leaf
      Page，填充率達 95%；右側展示隨機 UUIDv4 插入中間滿載 Page，引發頻繁頁分裂
      (Page Split) 與磁碟隨機 I/O。
    </desc>

    <!-- Column 1: Monotonic ID (Height: 260, Y: 30, Bottom margin: 30px) -->
    <g transform="translate(20, 30)">
      <rect
        width="385"
        height="260"
        rx="12"
        class="id-split-diagram__card id-split-diagram__card--green"></rect>
      <text
        class="id-split-diagram__badge id-split-diagram__badge--green"
        x="20"
        y="32">IDEAL FOR INNODB</text
      >
      <text
        class="id-split-diagram__title id-split-diagram__title--green"
        x="20"
        y="60"
      >
        ✔ 單調遞增 ID (Snowflake / UUIDv7)
      </text>

      <!-- Page Buffer Block -->
      <g transform="translate(18, 80)">
        <rect
          width="349"
          height="52"
          rx="8"
          class="id-split-diagram__page-box id-split-diagram__page-box--green"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="id-split-diagram__page-text id-split-diagram__page-text--green"
          x="174"
          y="32"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          [Page 1: 1..3] ➔ [Page 2: 4..6] ➔ [Page 3: 7..9] ➔ 追加新頁
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- Characteristics -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 150)">
        <text class="id-split-diagram__desc" x="0" y="20"
          >• 每次寫入精確追加在最末尾 Leaf Page</text
        >
        <text class="id-split-diagram__desc" x="0" y="44"
          >• 頁面物理填充率高達 95% 以上，零內部碎片</text
        >
        <text
          class="id-split-diagram__highlight id-split-diagram__highlight--green"
          x="0"
          y="72"
        >
          極致 Buffer Pool 命中率・純順序磁碟寫入！
        </text>
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 2: Random UUIDv4 (Height: 260, Y: 30, Bottom margin: 30px) -->
    <g transform="translate(435, 30)">
      <rect
        width="385"
        height="260"
        rx="12"
        class="id-split-diagram__card id-split-diagram__card--red"></rect>
      <text
        class="id-split-diagram__badge id-split-diagram__badge--red"
        x="20"
        y="32">PERFORMANCE DISASTER</text
      >
      <text
        class="id-split-diagram__title id-split-diagram__title--red"
        x="20"
        y="60"
      >
        ✖ 隨機 UUIDv4 (引發頁分裂)
      </text>

      <!-- Page Split Box -->
      <g transform="translate(18, 80)">
        <rect
          width="349"
          height="52"
          rx="8"
          class="id-split-diagram__page-box id-split-diagram__page-box--red"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="id-split-diagram__page-text id-split-diagram__page-text--red"
          x="174"
          y="32"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          隨機插入已滿載中間 Page ➔ 觸發 Page Split 頁分裂！
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- Characteristics -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 150)">
        <text class="id-split-diagram__desc" x="0" y="20"
          >• 強制搬移舊頁 50% 數據至新磁碟頁</text
        >
        <text class="id-split-diagram__desc" x="0" y="44"
          >• 空間嚴重碎片化，頁面填充率驟降至 50%</text
        >
        <text
          class="id-split-diagram__highlight id-split-diagram__highlight--red"
          x="0"
          y="72"
        >
          寫入吞吐量斷崖式暴跌 70%~85%！
        </text>
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile vertical layout -->
  <div class="id-split-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="id-split-mobile-card id-split-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="id-split-mobile-badge id-split-mobile-badge--green"
        >RECOMMENDED</span
      >
      <h4>順序單調遞增 ID (Snowflake / UUIDv7)</h4>
      <p>
        每次插入皆直接追加在最末尾葉子節點（Leaf Page），頁面填充率高達 95%
        以上，享受純順序 I/O 與極致快取效能。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="id-split-mobile-card id-split-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="id-split-mobile-badge id-split-mobile-badge--red"
        >AVOID IN RDBMS</span
      >
      <h4>隨機 UUIDv4 (B+ Tree 效能殺手)</h4>
      <p>
        隨機 Hash 插入滿載的中間節點引發頻繁頁分裂（Page
        Split），空間利用率暴跌至 50%，千萬級高壓寫入吞吐量衰減達 70%~85%。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="id-split-caption">
    圖：關聯式資料庫寫入效能對比 —— 順序單調遞增 ID 最佳化追加 vs. 隨機 UUIDv4
    頁分裂衝擊
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .id-split-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Base Tokens */
  .id-split-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__card--green {
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__card--green {
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__card--red {
    stroke: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__card--red {
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__badge--green {
    fill: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__badge--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__badge--red {
    fill: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__badge--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__title {
    font-size: 16.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__title--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__title--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__title--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__title--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__page-box {
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__page-box--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.06);
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__page-box--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.14);
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__page-box--red {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.06);
    stroke: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__page-box--red {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.14);
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__page-text {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__page-text--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__page-text--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__page-text--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__page-text--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .id-split-diagram__highlight {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__highlight--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__highlight--green {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  .id-split-diagram__highlight--red {
    fill: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-diagram__highlight--red {
    fill: #f87171;
  }

  figcaption {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Mobile Breakpoint (≤ 48rem / 768px) */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .id-split-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .id-split-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .id-split-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.875rem;
      padding: 1.125rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .id-split-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-mobile-card--green {
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.1);
      border-color: #4ade80;
    }

    .id-split-mobile-card--red {
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-mobile-card--red {
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.1);
      border-color: #f87171;
    }

    .id-split-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    }

    .id-split-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #86efac;
    }

    .id-split-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #dc2626;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .id-split-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #fca5a5;
    }

    .id-split-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .id-split-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  }
</style>
